  "bodyHash": "0212340c000da8d0",
  "content": "\n\n<p>Create But Brassless 是一款材質包，將列車車殼的材質從黃銅改為更接近鐵的樣式。為了保持一致性，它也會替換其他包含列車車殼相關方塊的擴充模組材質！你知道的，純粹為了統一風格！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1336/291/2025-09-26_01-44-25-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1081\"></p>\n<p>目前支援的模組：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create（這不用說）</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-blocks-bogies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Blocks &amp; Bogies</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-encased\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Encased</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-train-parts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Train Parts</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-mixed-casing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Mixed Casing</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-new-furnitures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create : New Furnitures</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dramatic-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dramatic Doors（裡面有 Create 的門，別問）</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-prismatic-shine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Prismatic Shine</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-trash-cans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Trash Cans（材質包）</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>如果我在其他模組中找到更多需要「去黃銅化」的列車車殼，我會嘗試加入支援。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
